t thorough research. Illegal multi-storey buildings in merged areas are facing potential demolition due to inadequate development plans. Permissions for construction are now contingent on the regional plan approved by PMRDA.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/pune-pmc-cautions-property-buyers-against-purchasing-illegal-constructions-in-merged-areas/132981736?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-121262/132981736.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}